{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "8c83481e71dc993c97463d27df2ed1734c21f8ad890996573cb95df398a873c1", "ja": "2コ2コデートツアー", "zh": "2人2人约会之旅", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4240c2aaa61c0d24fba8c5589c15344d4404b4b95deb0dfa7580cf866e6bbcf6", "ja": "ジュリアと恵美に言われるがまま、車を出す\nプロデューサー。アロマショップやゲームセ\nンターを巡ったり、クレープを食べさせても\nらったり、振り回されながらも楽しい時間を\n過ごす。", "zh": "制作人任由茱莉亚和惠美说什么就做什么，开车出门。\n一路逛了香薰店和游戏中心，还让她们请吃了可丽饼，虽然被折腾得团团转，\n却也度过了一段快乐的时光。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "06c78445a068f58fb58d6a2716cd2f534ebc624d476870c2c6a2ada22ae267b1", "ja": "（ジュリアと恵美に、なにがなんだか\nわからないまま、さらわれてしまった）", "zh": "（在完全搞不清状况的情况下，被茱莉亚和惠美拐走了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_04_1001_p", "source_sha256": "abc7937382fc08d6251e3e85972f6f5171ced7a421e31de89568d557dbcd4194", "ja": "（車を出して欲しいそうだ。時間はどうにか\n空けられたけど……一体どこに行くつもりだろう？）", "zh": "（好像是想让我开车。时间总算是挤出来了，不过……到底打算去哪里呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_04_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "de1fb9561b12d5a5ee58e3234e0438c9a3b3ff3b9dbd3cf5af66c52de75f5337", "ja": "ここ、ここ！　可憐が教えてくれたお店。\nアロマのおためしができるんだって。", "zh": "就是这里，就是这里！可怜告诉我的店。\n听说可以试用香薰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_04_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "737fd9d5a34a29d2ba3c08726e4ad1605f5b878c9478aacd618142de75f0f80b", "ja": "よーしっ、{$P$}、\nキリキリ歩けよな！　ははっ。", "zh": "好——嘞，{$P$}，\n快点跟上来啊！哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_04_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b52412497fa70257c255edf3c2dde623b908cd3b08d719d24d76a8ef6f0f3412", "ja": "なんだ、ショッピングがしたかったのか？\nじゃあ外で待ってるよ。", "zh": "怎么，你是想去逛街吗？\n那我在外面等你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_04_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "38edeb410ce539d3ef0a4af021b19bf1fc47a057d5d5db20dd1b18af81a6a0ef", "ja": "ダメダメ！　{$P$}も\n来てよ～。せっかく一緒なんだから。", "zh": "不行不行！　{$P$}也一起来嘛～\n难得我们在一起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_04_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "c1f2710b341b06a51bd1187078138e6fd734767ac1227d684ac5e8b398bcde1a", "ja": "サボるなって。\nしっかり働いてもらうぜ？　荷物持ちとか。", "zh": "都说了别偷懒。\n得让你老老实实干活才行啊？比如帮忙拿行李什么的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_04_1007_p", "source_sha256": "75351e1aa85215a4e8d13c459d39b62c16274005ee0cebf187129bec16fe10d7", "ja": "はあ……。", "zh": "这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_04_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "18434dda47fc26987fbcae8c680b0a5fbb16a007a2a2ba5783b81d30026a3ffc", "ja": "え～っとね……こっちの、\nネロリとか、ベルガモットとかがいいみたい？", "zh": "呃～……这个，像苦橙叶、佛手柑之类的比较好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_04_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "4bbe7c0016b7cd68f41962b7b7a83e38f1c7d5c5cc060cf97601a9419d2ecd36", "ja": "どれどれ？　くんくん……へえ、なるほどね。\nほら、{$P$}も！", "zh": "让我看看？闻闻……哦，原来如此。\n来，{$P$}也闻闻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_04_1010_p", "source_sha256": "36f3f8d62c87cd4bc4da121d8d5286cde678b7dd9b993b673f37ed0f2dd2d0b3", "ja": "ん？　ああ……くんくん、くんくん……。\nうん、柑橘系だな。爽やかな感じだ……くんくん！", "zh": "嗯？啊……闻闻，闻闻……  \n嗯，是柑橘类的。感觉很清爽……闻闻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_04_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "52b98d3fcd07a96d7feb3fcb55ea9deec6e6ef179c145c03832bc4c4ad08b468", "ja": "お、おい……嗅ぎすぎだろ！\nってか、あたしの指まで嗅ぐな！", "zh": "喂、喂……你闻得太过头了吧！\n话说，别连我的手指都闻啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_04_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "9ac336b91a046eef39d5d5dc19c2e4a33175c6ca696f97b745ad6aca7015dbf1", "ja": "にゃはは！　気に入った？\nんじゃ、この辺のヤツ買おうっと。すみませーん！", "zh": "呀哈哈！喜欢吗？\n那我就买这附近的吧。不好意思——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_04_1013_p", "source_sha256": "bc501333ed94fe56923836ec84ac444b70e96b15991e554cee517bcb2a12ba34", "ja": "（あちこち、ふたりの買い物に\n付き合っていたら、荷物がとんでもないことに……！）", "zh": "（陪着她们俩到处买东西，结果行李变得不得了……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_04_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "b8e181e7c728335fdc419c83f9ac9aa076fc6c487bb558868fc86ec4802ba701", "ja": "わっ、なんか{$P$}、\nすごいことになっちゃったね～。", "zh": "哇，感觉{$P$}，\n变得好夸张了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_04_1015_p", "source_sha256": "48f38bb6aafc88092ec52154667cab205f6ae7cdbe812cc34f27caef78126070", "ja": "よくこんなに買ったな……。\nまあ、そろそろ夏物の時期だからか。", "zh": "居然买了这么多……  \n不过，毕竟也差不多到该买夏装的时候了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_04_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "35506a3ff45d168bfb78f1d48a074eb7700ec5122b4063fc20030d8a39077d16", "ja": "よし、次は……あっちのゲーセン行こうぜ。\n{$P$}、音ゲーで勝負だ！", "zh": "好，接下来……去那边的游戏厅吧。\n{$P$}，来音游上一决胜负！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_04_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "2a27c19697e5faa0b75a8a54b83af78d106a4c85adcb4a37af2511feed4369ca", "ja": "あ、アタシあのぬいぐるみ欲しいかも！\n取ってよ、{$P$}。", "zh": "啊，我好像想要那个玩偶！\n帮我抓到它，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_04_1018_p", "source_sha256": "2b2e40aab3b848f0f742455f272a1c6eea8c645f308358ddeb8b554e6643cb36", "ja": "え、あっ……ちょ、ちょっと待って……。\nぐっ、う、動きづらい……！", "zh": "呃，啊……等、等一下……。\n唔，动、动起来好困难……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_04_1020_020meg", "source_sha256": "0d279da59aa59309ef5b02427b144f0a5c560ec245a6b2fecf667e993b390ce7", "ja": "{$P$}、おまたせっ！\nいやー、だいぶ並んじゃったよ。", "zh": "{$P$}，久等啦！哎呀，排了好长的队呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_04_1021_p", "source_sha256": "529faa6085f3a7acd6cd6ecc74646d3afaa7c54fab633e448c01533ca4d56f44", "ja": "おかえり。人気のクレープ屋なんだな。", "zh": "欢迎回来。原来是家很受欢迎的可丽饼店啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_04_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "eeeeb85e4d94da354b4d58279a3f1b16d99c0c97ee7528ccb47695f4030838ff", "ja": "メチャクチャでかいぞ、これ。\n恵美が同じのにしろって言うから……食い切れるか？", "zh": "这也太大了吧。\n因为惠美说要我选一样的……我吃得完吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_04_1023_020meg", "source_sha256": "b1172c507e13e894c2cbc547026126cd9b53bc2bb34443eb5125df39e7b54ae1", "ja": "にゃはは♪　別腹別腹～。\n{$P$}は？　本当に要らないの？", "zh": "呀哈哈♪ 另一个胃另一个胃～。\n{$P$}呢？真的不要吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_04_1024_p", "source_sha256": "b7969cc8a5ac28ffd2ed7155656eda2baa34679f4b62118544c3b4e75a0a1bef", "ja": "うん。荷物で両手がふさがってるから。", "zh": "嗯。因为手上都拿着行李，腾不出手来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_04_1025_020meg", "source_sha256": "be457edd920f1b34f26519fd4405c3f270ea04459b33b9d1ce9c0961d26a06f8", "ja": "しょうがないな～、んじゃ、アタシたちが\n食べさせたげるよ♪　ね、ジュリア？", "zh": "真拿你没办法～那就由我们来喂你吃吧♪ 对吧，茱莉亚？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_04_1026_050jul", "source_sha256": "777e2204cb6063e7cfbd8037c2ccdae7a7cdac6df2b74362f6dccc2f44eee587", "ja": "あたしもかよ！？　は～……しゃーねえ。\nほら、{$P$}！", "zh": "我也要来吗！？唉……没办法。\n来，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_04_1027_050jul", "source_sha256": "d6085dc90726059740584500013d25042b19fdc53b2dee7e930ff0a912c09b92", "ja": "あ～ん！", "zh": "嘴巴张开～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_04_1028_020meg", "source_sha256": "d6085dc90726059740584500013d25042b19fdc53b2dee7e930ff0a912c09b92", "ja": "あ～ん！", "zh": "嘴巴张开～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_04_1029_p", "source_sha256": "9bda8318dd002d09e1b45fa63a98e1cf9232912eb1d7599052b04cb8951215f0", "ja": "お、おい、ふたりとも！　急にそんな、\nええと……。", "zh": "喂、喂，你们两个！突然这样，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_04_1030", "source_sha256": "0abd3cf6bebd28fd19cb087e89a25ac8583cea92e0da7cdc6727b0ed7002d629", "ja": "あーん！", "zh": "啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_04_2000_p", "source_sha256": "3a5370688235a7af709e2f37a2c84dc789b3e5f36775882e9da1bc0abe7da2a6", "ja": "っとと、あーん！　……モグッ！？\nちょ、もググ、むグ……い、一気に入れすぎだって！", "zh": "等、等等，啊——！……咕唔！？  \n等、唔唔、呜……你、你一下子塞得太多了啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_04_2001_020meg", "source_sha256": "d692394b38ac79f192ba3c6c24f960e4c27ae5158ae29f559732d6c5a59719f2", "ja": "にゃはははは♪　ほらほら、もっかい。", "zh": "呀哈哈哈哈♪ 来来，再来一次。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_04_2002_050jul", "source_sha256": "0875f723914ce6837cb6c2388837bd8a00e42689049aca145a68900340ad6820", "ja": "満足したか？　バカP！\nなら、車回してくれよな。ウチら荷物見とくからさ。", "zh": "满足了吧？笨蛋P！\n那就把车开过来吧。我们会帮忙看着行李的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
